  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog 0.0.11\n\n## Changes (initial history)\n\n- Fix the wording of the publishing section (`2df7408`)\n- Publish with DotnetDeployer.Fleet instead of Azure Pipelines (`1f2ca7c`)\n- Harden the reader against hostile and corrupt logs (`7d6aa41`)\n- Name everything SoulConverter and add the NuGet pipeline (`5f7dc12`)\n- Test every direction and the command line through the public API (`0caa0e8`)\n- Remove the Python converter now that the port matches it (`032ddb6`)\n- Port the converter to .NET as the SoulConverter library (`4fa375b`)\n- feat: add Game Boy to NES VGM conversion (`5f366ac`)\n- Say what the licence is before publishing (`a43c99a`)\n- Let the bass line run instead of restarting it every note (`897b618`)\n- Stop the drums from playing in the bass's register (`be7bf9a`)\n- Hear a drum the driver retuned as a different drum (`ccb1706`)\n- Recognise DPCM used as a melodic instrument, not just as a drum kit (`dd579cf`)\n- Re-synthesise the DPCM channel on the Game Boy's four generators (`cec7b62`)\n- Convert NES 2A03 VGM themes to Game Boy DMG VGM (`d30c8e4`)\n",
